  "body": "[![WhiteSource Renovate](https://app.renovatebot.com/images/banner.svg)](https://renovatebot.com)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Adoption | Passing | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [@testing-library/jest-dom](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom) | [`4.1.0` -> `4.2.4`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@testing-library%2fjest-dom/4.1.0/4.2.4) | [![age](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/@testing-library%2fjest-dom/4.2.4/age-slim)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![adoption](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/@testing-library%2fjest-dom/4.2.4/adoption-slim)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![passing](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/@testing-library%2fjest-dom/4.2.4/compatibility-slim/4.1.0)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![confidence](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/@testing-library%2fjest-dom/4.2.4/confidence-slim/4.1.0)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>testing-library/jest-dom</summary>\n\n### [`v4.2.4`](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/releases/v4.2.4)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/compare/v4.2.3...v4.2.4)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Issue with lowercasing toHaveStyle values. ([#&#8203;164](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/issues/164)) ([d5f21b3](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/commit/d5f21b3b8487a0aae9ba1be8ee5b62893adb7b3a))\n\n### [`v4.2.3`](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/releases/v4.2.3)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/compare/v4.2.2...v4.2.3)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   improve error messages for .toBeInTheDocument ([#&#8203;137](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/issues/137)) ([c12a476](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/commit/c12a476b66c9d921bad017394c2b4e65a4315790))\n\n### [`v4.2.2`](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/releases/v4.2.2)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/compare/v4.2.1...v4.2.2)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Changed .toHaveStyle() to be case-insensitive. ([#&#8203;154](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/issues/154)) ([9a36d66](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/commit/9a36d665f826539f8867fff3e74a98b6b0e8fadf))\n\n### [`v4.2.1`](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/releases/v4.2.1)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/compare/v4.2.0...v4.2.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Update type for Matchers to match [@&#8203;types/jest](https://togithub.com/types/jest) ([#&#8203;150](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/issues/150)) ([f881e68](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/commit/f881e689eb8c8d764f7828d93497bd8ac435108e))\n\n### [`v4.2.0`](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/releases/v4.2.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/compare/v4.1.2...v4.2.0)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Add toBeChecked matcher ([#&#8203;141](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/issues/141)) ([ed0b272](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/commit/ed0b27293bee589a999ab39d920ae29473ee3eef))\n\n### [`v4.1.2`](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/releases/v4.1.2)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/compare/v4.1.1...v4.1.2)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   toHaveStyle not to return true when shouldn't ([#&#8203;81](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/issues/81)) ([d048768](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/commit/d048768dc01abd8e5fa5144689e4d27f6e024b99))\n\n### [`v4.1.1`](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/releases/v4.1.1)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/compare/v4.1.0...v4.1.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   toHaveTextContent(\"\")  causing false positive ([#&#8203;138](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/issues/138)) ([cdc8a06](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/commit/cdc8a06)), closes [#&#8203;104](https://togithub.com/testing-library/jest-dom/issues/104)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Disabled due to failing status checks.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [WhiteSource Renovate](https://renovate.whitesourcesoftware.com). View repository job log [here](https://app.renovatebot.com/dashboard#github/algolia/instantsearch.js).",
